  "details": "When switching audio output device in the SteamVR options (under the audio tab), for example switching from headset to manual, and selecting a bluetooth headset, VRChat sometimes stops sending player voice.\n\nThis means you can't hear anyone, the nameplate effect indicating that they are talking is also absent, and their mouth isn't moving, but people will still hear you talk.\n\nThis usually requires a game restart to fix.",
